e token belief, τ's producer, the cascade path's Q(o|π)). Map edits alone reach 13 of 37. RC7+RC8 DONE (futon2 9c4cc59a, p4ng 6eb809d8; claude-3, ~13:59Z; claude-8: record check holds, figures published): the five pointer corrections landed with every site read first; F_π typed not live, the chain dead from the top (`f-pi-dark-readback` has no production caller) and three false tick pointers on its row corrected; not-realised 2 → 8; ten edges into `:holes` in five entries; three belief edges kept out of the holes because they are realised through R3's update. WM-PROVER-POSITIONAL-D DONE (futon3c 5f249090): `:passes` covers 5 of 7, WM-PROVER-PASSES-I on claude-2. Node packets started: WM-NODE-R2-R3a-I on claude-10; G2 (drawn holes shown) on claude-11. The 17 no-path edges are PROOF-2a-PLAN ⟨2⟩2d, code wires, held for Joe. See PROOF-2a-PLAN ⟨2⟩2b, ⟨2⟩2c and ⟨1⟩3 (H-T-CALLER). H6 (`target-view` → construction, `:universes`) and H8 (the assembly's `:sources` into `assemble-one`'s `:want`, where R19→R5 would become a wire) queued behind it; H7 (judge-opts → flight-assembly-input) is covered by H3. WM-HANDOFF-H1-I DONE (futon3c b9d18dfe map + fixture + map test + lane table, cfc355a0 figures and matrix, e31c059d ledger re-pin; claude-10, ~12:18Z; claude-8: record check holds, four warrants 6ac29f8e map, cd00996a replay, c38107e1 projection, a35f73ac ledger 3/205, figures published). `:flight-run` (`flight/run!`, no row: it is the whole loop) writes `:readings` and `:needs` and reads `:needs` itself; `:flight-driver-summary` (`flight_driver/run-flight!`) reads both, their only reader after the flight. `:needs` has four textual producers (`read-fn`'s and `ask-fn`'s return maps, `record-click`'s append, `run!`'s merge); the box is `run!`, the others standing occurrences with notes; `read-fn` not declared as reading `:needs` since it only returns it. Findings 197 → 218 (21 standing: `:needs` at nine sites, `run!`'s and `run-flight!`'s own keys, one `:declared-write-not-found`